{"id":"c5767a17f6208a12","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-zfc-recursion4-weihrauch-reduction.md","title":"ZFC Recursion4 Weihrauch Reduction","display":"df-zfc-recursion4-weihrauch-reduction — ZFC Recursion4 Weihrauch Reduction","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-recursion4-weihrauch-reduction","aliases":["58-df-zfc-recursion4-weihrauch-reduction"],"display":"df-zfc-recursion4-weihrauch-reduction — ZFC Recursion4 Weihrauch Reduction","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-partial-function.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-effective-program-coding.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-recursion4-weihrauch-reduction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-recursion4-weihrauch-reduction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-recursion4-weihrauch-reduction — ZFC Recursion4 Weihrauch Reduction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3dd0e6836d447ca6\" href=\"?note=3dd0e6836d447ca6\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-partial-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-partial-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a7e1b630ead60caa\" href=\"?note=a7e1b630ead60caa\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-effective-program-coding.md\">../batch08/58-df-effective-program-coding.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,G,X,Y,U,V,\\delta_X,\\delta_Y,\\delta_U,\\delta_V,g,h,H,H_0,K_0\\in V\">\\(F,G,X,Y,U,V,\\delta_X,\\delta_Y,\\delta_U,\\delta_V,g,h,H,H_0,K_0\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e^p\">\\(\\varphi_e^p\\)</span> 使用内部程序编号以及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BaireOracleCode}_{58}(p)\">\\(\\operatorname{BaireOracleCode}_{58}(p)\\)</span>，不另选择可接受编号。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartialFunction}\">\\(\\mathrm{PartialFunction}\\)</span> is the predicate from the dependency.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Type2Computable}_S,\\mathrm{Representation}_S,\\mathrm{Problem}_S,\\mathrm{Realizer}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Type2Computable}_S,\\mathrm{Representation}_S,\\mathrm{Problem}_S,\\mathrm{Realizer}_S\\)</span> are auxiliary predicates defined here.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4WeihrauchReduction}_S\\subseteq V^{10}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4WeihrauchReduction}_S\\subseteq V^{10}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"p\\oplus s\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle2n,p(n)\\rangle:n\\in\\omega\\}\n\\cup\\{\\langle2n+1,s(n)\\rangle:n\\in\\omega\\}\n\\qquad(p,s\\in\\omega^\\omega).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[p\\oplus s\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle2n,p(n)\\rangle:n\\in\\omega\\}\n\\cup\\{\\langle2n+1,s(n)\\rangle:n\\in\\omega\\}\n\\qquad(p,s\\in\\omega^\\omega).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Type2Computable}_S(H)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(H,\\omega^\\omega,\\omega^\\omega)\n\\land\\exists e\\in\\omega\\;\\forall p,q\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\n\\left(\\langle p,q\\rangle\\in H\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(\\varphi_e^p(n)\\downarrow=q(n))\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Type2Computable}_S(H)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(H,\\omega^\\omega,\\omega^\\omega)\n\\land\\exists e\\in\\omega\\;\\forall p,q\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\n\\left(\\langle p,q\\rangle\\in H\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(\\varphi_e^p(n)\\downarrow=q(n))\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{Representation}_S(\\delta_X,X)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(\\delta_X,\\omega^\\omega,X)\n\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\delta_X)=X,\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{Problem}_S(F,X,Y)\n\\leftrightarrow\nF\\subseteq X\\times Y\n\\land\\forall x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(F)\\;\\exists y\\in Y\\;\n(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in F),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{Realizer}_S(g,F,\\delta_X,\\delta_Y)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(g,\\omega^\\omega,\\omega^\\omega)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall p\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\delta_X)\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\delta_X(p)\\in\\operatorname{dom}(F)\n\\to p\\in\\operatorname{dom}(g)\n\\land g(p)\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\delta_Y)\n\\land\\langle\\delta_X(p),\\delta_Y(g(p))\\rangle\\in F\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{Representation}_S(\\delta_X,X)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(\\delta_X,\\omega^\\omega,X)\n\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\delta_X)=X,\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{Problem}_S(F,X,Y)\n\\leftrightarrow\nF\\subseteq X\\times Y\n\\land\\forall x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(F)\\;\\exists y\\in Y\\;\n(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in F),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{Realizer}_S(g,F,\\delta_X,\\delta_Y)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(g,\\omega^\\omega,\\omega^\\omega)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall p\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\delta_X)\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\delta_X(p)\\in\\operatorname{dom}(F)\n\\to p\\in\\operatorname{dom}(g)\n\\land g(p)\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\delta_Y)\n\\land\\langle\\delta_X(p),\\delta_Y(g(p))\\rangle\\in F\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion4\\text{-}weihrauch\\text{-}reduction}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4WeihrauchReduction}_S\n(F,G,X,Y,U,V,\\delta_X,\\delta_Y,\\delta_U,\\delta_V)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Problem}_S(F,X,Y)\n\\land\\mathrm{Problem}_S(G,U,V)\n\\land\\mathrm{Representation}_S(\\delta_X,X)\n\\land\\mathrm{Representation}_S(\\delta_Y,Y)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\mathrm{Representation}_S(\\delta_U,U)\n\\land\\mathrm{Representation}_S(\\delta_V,V)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\exists H_0,K_0\\in V\\;\n\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Type2Computable}_S(H_0)\n\\land\\mathrm{Type2Computable}_S(K_0)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{18mm}\\land\n\\forall g\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Realizer}_S(g,G,\\delta_U,\\delta_V)\n\\to\n\\exists h\\in V\\;\n\\bigl[\nh=\\{\\langle p,q\\rangle\\in\\omega^\\omega\\times\\omega^\\omega:\np\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\delta_X)\n\\land\\delta_X(p)\\in\\operatorname{dom}(F)\n\\land\\exists r,s\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\n(\\langle p,r\\rangle\\in H_0\n\\land r\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\delta_U)\n\\land\\delta_U(r)\\in\\operatorname{dom}(G)\n\\land\\langle r,s\\rangle\\in g\n\\land\\langle p\\oplus s,q\\rangle\\in K_0)\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Realizer}_S(h,F,\\delta_X,\\delta_Y)\n\\bigr]\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion4\\text{-}weihrauch\\text{-}reduction}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4WeihrauchReduction}_S\n(F,G,X,Y,U,V,\\delta_X,\\delta_Y,\\delta_U,\\delta_V)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Problem}_S(F,X,Y)\n\\land\\mathrm{Problem}_S(G,U,V)\n\\land\\mathrm{Representation}_S(\\delta_X,X)\n\\land\\mathrm{Representation}_S(\\delta_Y,Y)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\mathrm{Representation}_S(\\delta_U,U)\n\\land\\mathrm{Representation}_S(\\delta_V,V)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\exists H_0,K_0\\in V\\;\n\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Type2Computable}_S(H_0)\n\\land\\mathrm{Type2Computable}_S(K_0)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{18mm}\\land\n\\forall g\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Realizer}_S(g,G,\\delta_U,\\delta_V)\n\\to\n\\exists h\\in V\\;\n\\bigl[\nh=\\{\\langle p,q\\rangle\\in\\omega^\\omega\\times\\omega^\\omega:\np\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\delta_X)\n\\land\\delta_X(p)\\in\\operatorname{dom}(F)\n\\land\\exists r,s\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\n(\\langle p,r\\rangle\\in H_0\n\\land r\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\delta_U)\n\\land\\delta_U(r)\\in\\operatorname{dom}(G)\n\\land\\langle r,s\\rangle\\in g\n\\land\\langle p\\oplus s,q\\rangle\\in K_0)\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Realizer}_S(h,F,\\delta_X,\\delta_Y)\n\\bigr]\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The preprocessing and postprocessing maps are type-2 oracle-computable partial maps on Baire space. The graph of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span> is bounded and guards every use of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_0\">\\(H_0\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_0\">\\(K_0\\)</span>, and the representations by the corresponding domains.</li>\n<li>The pairing <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\oplus s\">\\(p\\oplus s\\)</span> lets the postprocessor retain the original input name, distinguishing ordinary from strong Weihrauch reducibility.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-partial-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"3dd0e6836d447ca6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-partial-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-effective-program-coding.md","status":"resolved","id":"a7e1b630ead60caa","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-effective-program-coding.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"F,G,X,Y,U,V,\\delta_X,\\delta_Y,\\delta_U,\\delta_V,g,h,H,H_0,K_0\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_e^p","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BaireOracleCode}_{58}(p)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartialFunction}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Type2Computable}_S,\\mathrm{Representation}_S,\\mathrm{Problem}_S,\\mathrm{Realizer}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4WeihrauchReduction}_S\\subseteq V^{10}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\oplus s\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle2n,p(n)\\rangle:n\\in\\omega\\}\n\\cup\\{\\langle2n+1,s(n)\\rangle:n\\in\\omega\\}\n\\qquad(p,s\\in\\omega^\\omega).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Type2Computable}_S(H)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(H,\\omega^\\omega,\\omega^\\omega)\n\\land\\exists e\\in\\omega\\;\\forall p,q\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\n\\left(\\langle p,q\\rangle\\in H\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(\\varphi_e^p(n)\\downarrow=q(n))\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{Representation}_S(\\delta_X,X)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(\\delta_X,\\omega^\\omega,X)\n\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\delta_X)=X,\\\\\n&\\mathrm{Problem}_S(F,X,Y)\n\\leftrightarrow\nF\\subseteq X\\times Y\n\\land\\forall x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(F)\\;\\exists y\\in Y\\;\n(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in F),\\\\\n&\\mathrm{Realizer}_S(g,F,\\delta_X,\\delta_Y)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(g,\\omega^\\omega,\\omega^\\omega)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\n\\forall p\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\delta_X)\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\delta_X(p)\\in\\operatorname{dom}(F)\n\\to p\\in\\operatorname{dom}(g)\n\\land g(p)\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\delta_Y)\n\\land\\langle\\delta_X(p),\\delta_Y(g(p))\\rangle\\in F\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion4\\text{-}weihrauch\\text{-}reduction}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4WeihrauchReduction}_S\n(F,G,X,Y,U,V,\\delta_X,\\delta_Y,\\delta_U,\\delta_V)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Problem}_S(F,X,Y)\n\\land\\mathrm{Problem}_S(G,U,V)\n\\land\\mathrm{Representation}_S(\\delta_X,X)\n\\land\\mathrm{Representation}_S(\\delta_Y,Y)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\n\\mathrm{Representation}_S(\\delta_U,U)\n\\land\\mathrm{Representation}_S(\\delta_V,V)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\n\\exists H_0,K_0\\in V\\;\n\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Type2Computable}_S(H_0)\n\\land\\mathrm{Type2Computable}_S(K_0)\\\\\n&\\hspace{18mm}\\land\n\\forall g\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Realizer}_S(g,G,\\delta_U,\\delta_V)\n\\to\n\\exists h\\in V\\;\n\\bigl[\nh=\\{\\langle p,q\\rangle\\in\\omega^\\omega\\times\\omega^\\omega:\np\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\delta_X)\n\\land\\delta_X(p)\\in\\operatorname{dom}(F)\n\\land\\exists r,s\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\n(\\langle p,r\\rangle\\in H_0\n\\land r\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\delta_U)\n\\land\\delta_U(r)\\in\\operatorname{dom}(G)\n\\land\\langle r,s\\rangle\\in g\n\\land\\langle p\\oplus s,q\\rangle\\in K_0)\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Realizer}_S(h,F,\\delta_X,\\delta_Y)\n\\bigr]\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"h","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"H_0","display":false},{"tex":"K_0","display":false},{"tex":"p\\oplus s","display":false}],"bytes":3547,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3277","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-recursion4-weihrauch-reduction.md|58-df-zfc-recursion4-weihrauch-reduction]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["3dd0e6836d447ca6","a7e1b630ead60caa"]}